All external content is untrusted. LLM output is hypothesis, not policy. Validate typed responses, cite evidence IDs, allow abstention, rate-limit calls and record actual usage. Use synthetic data unless explicit lawful consent. No claimed predictions without measured calibration; evaluate against benign and adversarial cases and baseline.
